  "description": "Social outcast Yeonhui dreams of fitting in with her schoolmates. But her social status doesn’t seem like it’s going to change anytime soon -- until an alien named I-an falls out of the sky and crashes into her hopeless life. He helps her transform herself, and she ends up in an exciting love triangle. Will Yeon-Hui choose I-An, the alien who helped her learn the true meaning of happiness, or Han-Je, the human boy who has been secretly protecting her before I-An appeared in her life? \n\n(Source: WEBTOONS)\n\n*Note: Includes 1 extra chapter.*",
